{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の1stアルバムのタイトルが\n決定しました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「  透明な色  」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケ写は乃木坂駅で撮影。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"typeAとtypeBに\nお姉さんメンバーが半分ずつ。\ntypeCが研究生含めた高校生メンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はtype.Bの一番奥にいるよ♡\n初めてジャケ写に姿形が写れて\nすごく嬉しいよーーー(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1stアルバムが\nものすごくものすごく楽しみ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはメンバーとしての気持ちなのか\nヲタクとしての気持ちなのか\n分からないのだけど...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバムに収録される\nカップリング10曲は\nメンバーもライブ当日まで\n知らないので\nドキドキしてます(´｡･o･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとアルバム特典"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現時点で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキ会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式式典"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アナザージャケット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が発表されてるね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキ会楽しみだけど、\n私もそのチェキ貰えないかなあ～(笑)\nみんなとの思い出 私も欲しい(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人式は私は去年\n終わったので関係ありません～！\n94年組のファンの方必見♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アナザージャケットは\nそれぞれのメンバーのジャケ写が\n各5枚あるからランダムで\n配られるみたいだね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDケースにいれれば\n初の私のソロジャケット"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな感じになるから\nこれは欲しい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"収録楽曲の新曲で\nアンダーメンバー＋研究生の曲\nあるんだよ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自由の彼方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもいい曲なので\nこちらもお楽しみに(   ´ω`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2014/12/06/7580310/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{